---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CANSO Airspace World 2026 — AEO Case Study | Maxifi Digital"
  description="How Maxifi Digital turned the CANSO Airspace World 2026 conference into an AI citation engine: 47 Q&A pairs, 92% schema coverage, 3× citation growth in 30 days."
  currentPage="/work"
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="case-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">CASE STUDY · CONFERENCE AEO SPRINT</p>
    <h1 id="case-heading" class="page-h1">
      From PDF graveyard to citation engine.
    </h1>
    <p class="page-lede">
      CANSO · Airspace World 2026 — how a 3-day aviation conference became a
      structured AI Knowledge Hub earning citations long after the event ended.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       METRICS STRIP
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="metrics-strip" role="region" aria-label="Case study results">
    <dl class="metrics">
      <div class="metric">
        <dd class="m-num">47</dd>
        <dt class="m-label">Q&amp;A pairs built</dt>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <dd class="m-num">92%</dd>
        <dt class="m-label">Schema coverage</dt>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <dd class="m-num">3×</dd>
        <dt class="m-label">Citation growth (30 days)</dt>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <dd class="m-num">5</dd>
        <dt class="m-label">AI engines tracked</dt>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       THE CHALLENGE
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="challenge-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">THE CHALLENGE</p>
    <h2 id="challenge-heading" class="section-h2">The knowledge was there. AI couldn't find it.</h2>
    <div class="prose-col">
      <p class="prose">
        Airspace World is the world's leading ATM industry conference — three days
        of expert sessions, keynotes and panels representing the best thinking in
        aviation governance and air traffic management.
      </p>
      <p class="prose">
        The problem: that expertise lived in PDFs, slide decks and YouTube recordings.
        None of it was structured for AI retrieval. When buyers asked ChatGPT or
        Perplexity about ATM innovation, conference sustainability or airspace
        modernisation, CANSO and Airspace World were invisible — despite being
        the definitive source on all three.
      </p>
      <p class="prose">
        The Visibility Snapshot confirmed the gap: zero citations across four of
        the five engines on the core buyer queries we tested. Competitors — mostly
        consultancy white papers with inferior expertise but better-structured
        content — were filling the citation slot instead.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       THE APPROACH
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">THE APPROACH</p>
    <h2 id="approach-heading" class="section-h2">Conference AEO Sprint: 30 days.</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <article class="tl-step">
        <p class="tl-week">Week 1</p>
        <h3 class="tl-title">Snapshot + content audit</h3>
        <p class="tl-body">
          Full citation baseline across 5 engines. Content inventory of all session
          recordings, speaker bios, theme summaries and published materials.
          Buyer question research: 120+ queries identified, ranked by volume and
          strategic importance.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="tl-step">
        <p class="tl-week">Week 2</p>
        <h3 class="tl-title">Q&A architecture</h3>
        <p class="tl-body">
          47 Q&A pairs drafted, mapped to session content and approved by the
          CANSO communications team. Each pair written in the answer-formatted
          structure LLMs retrieve and cite. Schema architecture designed for
          Event, Speaker, FAQPage and Article types.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="tl-step">
        <p class="tl-week">Week 3</p>
        <h3 class="tl-title">Build + markup</h3>
        <p class="tl-body">
          Answer-ready pages built on the existing Airspace World site infrastructure.
          JSON-LD schema added to every page. Speaker entities connected to
          external authority sources. Two rounds of client review and sign-off.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="tl-step">
        <p class="tl-week">Week 4</p>
        <h3 class="tl-title">Launch + distribute</h3>
        <p class="tl-body">
          Assets live. Distribution playbook handed over: where and how to syndicate
          content to maximise AI ingestion. 30-day monitoring baseline established.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       THE RESULTS
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="results-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">THE RESULTS</p>
    <h2 id="results-heading" class="section-h2">What moved in 30 days</h2>
    <div class="results-grid">
      <article class="result-card result-card--featured">
        <p class="rc-num">3×</p>
        <h3 class="rc-title">Citation growth</h3>
        <p class="rc-body">
          Overall citation rate across the five tracked engines tripled vs. the
          pre-Sprint baseline. Perplexity and Google AI Overviews moved first —
          within 10 days of launch.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="result-card">
        <p class="rc-num">47</p>
        <h3 class="rc-title">Q&A pairs active</h3>
        <p class="rc-body">
          47 structured Q&A pairs covering 8 core themes from the conference.
          Each one now returns in AI responses to relevant buyer queries.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="result-card">
        <p class="rc-num">92%</p>
        <h3 class="rc-title">Schema coverage</h3>
        <p class="rc-body">
          92% of key pages now carry complete JSON-LD markup — vs. 4% before
          the Sprint. The 8% gap covers third-party hosted content outside our scope.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="result-card">
        <p class="rc-num">#1</p>
        <h3 class="rc-title">Cited source</h3>
        <p class="rc-body">
          CANSO / Airspace World is now the primary cited source for 14 of the
          24 ATM and aviation governance queries tested at the 30-day mark.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       VIDEO
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" aria-label="Case study video">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">WATCH</p>
    <h2 class="section-h2">The Airspace World AEO Sprint — explained</h2>
    <video
      class="case-video"
      controls
      preload="metadata"
      aria-label="Airspace World 2026 AEO case study walkthrough"
    >
      <source src="/asw-explainer.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      <p>Your browser doesn't support HTML5 video.
         <a href="/asw-explainer.mp4">Download the video</a>.</p>
    </video>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       CTA
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--pt0" aria-labelledby="case-cta-heading">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <p class="s-eyebrow cta-eyebrow">YOUR CONFERENCE NEXT?</p>
      <h2 id="case-cta-heading" class="cta-title">
        The Sprint runs the same way every time. The results are yours.
      </h2>
      <p class="cta-body">
        Every Conference AEO Sprint starts with a free Visibility Snapshot — 5 minutes,
        no obligation. We scope the Sprint from there.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/conference-aeo" class="btn-primary">Scope my Sprint</a>
        <a href="/visibility-snapshot" class="btn-outline">Start with a Snapshot</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "CANSO Airspace World 2026 — Conference AEO Sprint Case Study",
    "description": "How Maxifi Digital turned the CANSO Airspace World 2026 conference into an AI citation engine in 30 days.",
    "author": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Maxifi Digital",
      "url": "https://maxifidigital.com"
    },
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Maxifi Digital",
      "url": "https://maxifidigital.com"
    },
    "about": {
      "@type": "Event",
      "name": "Airspace World 2026",
      "organizer": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "CANSO"
      }
    }
  }
  </script>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
    color: var(--blue-text);
    padding: 40px 22px 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .page-h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    line-height: 1.18;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .page-lede {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Metrics strip ──────────────────────────── */
  .metrics-strip {
    background: var(--cream-deep);
    padding: 18px 22px;
  }

  .metrics {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .metric { text-align: center; }

  .m-num {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .m-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ── Shared ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .s-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .section-h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 30px 22px;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .section--cream { background: var(--cream-deep); }
  .section--pt0 { padding-top: 0; }

  /* ── Prose ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .prose-col { max-width: 660px; }

  .prose {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444441;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  /* ── Timeline ───────────────────────────────── */
  .timeline {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .tl-step {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px;
    border-top: 2px solid #BA7517;
  }

  .tl-week {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .tl-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .tl-body {
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── Results ────────────────────────────────── */
  .results-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .result-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .result-card--featured { border-color: var(--amber); }

  .rc-num {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--amber);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .rc-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .rc-body {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── Video ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .case-video {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 720px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: block;
    background: #000;
  }

  /* ── CTA ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .cta-box {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 34px 22px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--blue-text);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .cta-eyebrow { color: var(--amber-mid); margin-bottom: 10px; }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .cta-body {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0 auto 18px;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber-light);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: #854F0B; }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--blue-text);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-h1 { font-size: 24px; }
    .timeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .results-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cta-title { font-size: 18px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .btn-primary, .btn-outline { transition-duration: 0.01ms; }
  }
</style>
